    "turn_text": "The year, 2042. The global population will reach 9 billion people. Here in the United States, ethnic and racial minorities will make up a majority of the population. In this MLY Podcast, Dana Afana and Bob Johnson explore how diversity will change our daily lives and what our communities will look like in 20 years. Welcome to the year, 2042. In this episode, Congresswoman Dingell joins the program along with statewide political reporter Malachi Barrett to talk about the incoming Biden administration and the impact it will have on the state of Michigan today and in 2042.",
