    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75416.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "Well, I'm going to say several things. One, it's going to be steady. It's going to be consistent. You won't have somebody that will say something one hour and say something different the next. Joe Biden knows that a strong auto industry is critical to a strong American economy. But he also knows that we've got to diversify our economy. We've got to create more jobs. We've got to be young people, the opportunity to get an education. But an education doesn't have to be the typical education. In the middle of the night, I don't need a lawyer, I need an nutrition or a plumber or a carpenter. These are very important drops and there's six figure salaries too that they're making. We need to make sure we're training the workforce. I think he's going to put money into that. I think he's going to try to help rebuild the sense of community. This country's been divided by fear and hatred.",
