    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "Thank you so much. Our podcast is called The Year 2042. It's predicted that minorities will outnumber non-Hispanic white people in the year 2042 in our country at least. And so using me, I'll ask this question. My question would be, how do you see the year 2042? And not only how do you see it, In fact, our lives, you know, if this was to happen.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
