    "turn_idx": 48,
    "turn_text": "great. Look, my little guy, I have never witnessed anything like this in my life. Like, wow, this went on, like, to the point where you really have to get to the day where they actually inaugurated him before you could just say, okay, this is finally over. What do you think a Biden administration is for Michigan?",
